{"title":"Combined feed","url":"https://Vinnl.github.io/feeds/all.xml","elements":[{"title":"Sanda Island Lighthouse (Wikipedia — did you know?)","contents":"... that the <b><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sanda_Island_Lighthouse\" title=\"Sanda Island Lighthouse\">Sanda Island Lighthouse</a></b> <i>(pictured)</i> was built in three \"steps\" against a cliff face, a design that is unique in Scotland?","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sanda_Island_Lighthouse","retrieved":1792491503423},{"title":"Bert Matter (Wikipedia — did you know?)","contents":"... that <b><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bert_Matter\" title=\"Bert Matter\">Bert Matter</a></b>, the organist at the <b><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Walburgiskerk,_Zutphen\" title=\"Walburgiskerk, Zutphen\">Walburgiskerk in Zutphen</a></b> for 33 years, composed <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Minimal_music\" title=\"Minimal music\">minimal music</a>?","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bert_Matter","retrieved":1792491503425},{"title":"a Michigan TV station (Wikipedia — did you know?)","contents":"... that <b><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/WKAR-TV\" title=\"WKAR-TV\">a Michigan TV station</a></b> once broadcast out of a former student cafeteria?","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/WKAR-TV","retrieved":1792491503427},{"title":"Stephan Steinlein (Wikipedia — did you know?)","contents":"... that <b><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Stephan_Steinlein\" title=\"Stephan Steinlein\">Stephan Steinlein</a></b>, Germany's current ambassador to France, held the exact same diplomatic post for East Germany more than three decades ago?","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Stephan_Steinlein","retrieved":1792491503427},{"title":"Battle of Satala (Wikipedia — did you know?)","contents":"... that the Byzantine victory at the <b><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Battle_of_Satala_(530)\" title=\"Battle of Satala (530)\">Battle of Satala</a></b> in 530 against a numerically superior Persian army depended on the actions of a single individual?","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Battle_of_Satala_(530)","retrieved":1792491503428},{"title":"Ben Streff (Wikipedia — did you know?)","contents":"... that <b><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ben_Streff\" title=\"Ben Streff\">Ben Streff</a></b> joined the <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Luxembourg_Socialist_Workers'_Party\" title=\"Luxembourg Socialist Workers' Party\">Luxembourg Socialist Workers' Party</a> at the age of 14, and was sworn in to the <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Chamber_of_Deputies_(Luxembourg)\" title=\"Chamber of Deputies (Luxembourg)\">Chamber of Deputies</a> at the age of 31?","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ben_Streff","retrieved":1792491503430},{"title":"Interstate 65 Tennessee River Bridge (Wikipedia — did you know?)","contents":"... that construction of the <b><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Interstate_65_Tennessee_River_Bridge\" title=\"Interstate 65 Tennessee River Bridge\">Interstate<span typeof=\"mw:Entity\">&nbsp;</span>65 Tennessee River Bridge</a></b> was halted each winter due to the presence of waterfowl?","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Interstate_65_Tennessee_River_Bridge","retrieved":1792491503430},{"title":"Jadwiga Szmidt (Wikipedia — did you know?)","contents":"... that physicist <b><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Jadwiga_Szmidt\" title=\"Jadwiga Szmidt\">Jadwiga Szmidt</a></b> nearly died of poisoning when she opened a container when working in <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ernest_Rutherford\" title=\"Ernest Rutherford\">Ernest Rutherford</a>'s laboratory at the <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/University_of_Manchester\" title=\"University of Manchester\">University of Manchester</a>?","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Jadwiga_Szmidt","retrieved":1792491503431},{"title":"assembly halls (Wikipedia — did you know?)","contents":"... that Chinese \"<b><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Huiguan\" title=\"Huiguan\">assembly halls</a></b>\" could simultaneously be social, religious, business, and political institutions?","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Huiguan","retrieved":1792491503432},{"title":"Destination of the Month (Wikivoyage recommendations)","contents":"<span class=\"mw-empty-elt\" about=\"#mwt8\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion\" id=\"mwIQ\" data-mw=\"{&quot;parts&quot;:[{&quot;template&quot;:{&quot;target&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;banner&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:&quot;./Template:Banner&quot;},&quot;params&quot;:{&quot;direction&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;right&quot;},&quot;title&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;Xi'an&quot;},&quot;type&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;dotm&quot;},&quot;image&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;XianBanner1.jpg&quot;},&quot;quote&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;China's ancient capital is the home of the Terracotta Warriors and has a history going back several millennia.&quot;}},&quot;i&quot;:0}}]}\"><style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r4523569\" typeof=\"mw:Extension/templatestyles\" about=\"#mwt9\" data-mw=\"{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;templatestyles&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;Banner/styles.css&quot;}}\">.mw-parser-output .mainpage-shadowbox{color:white;background:rgb(16,16,16);background:rgba(0,0,0,0.3);border-radius:4px}.mw-parser-output .mainpage-shadowbox h2,.mw-parser-output .mainpage-shadowbox h3{color:white;border:none;font-family:sans-serif;line-height:1.2em;margin:0;padding:0}.mw-parser-output .mainpage-shadowbox a{color:white;font-weight:bold}.mw-parser-output .banner-image{position:relative;max-width:1125px;height:auto;margin-bottom:.6em}.mw-parser-output .banner-image img{max-width:100%;hei